  "translation": "Wema ngqo ku-Uzziyahu inkosi, bathi kuye: “Akulunganga kuwe, Uzziyahu, ukuncoe iinkcenkceshane kuYahwe, kuba ngabangcwele-inkonzo kuphela, oonyana baka-Aharon, abangcwelekileyo ukuncoa. Phuma kwitempile engcwele, kuba wenze isiphulumo, yaye akusalunganga kuwe ukuzukisa ngoYahwe uElohim.”",
